", "thumbKey": "media/1791223574378_xpukkf.jpg"}, {"type": "video", "r2Key": "media/1791223575467_6rozzp.mp4", "thumbKey": "media/1791223574379_7q5qrw.jpg"}, {"type": "video", "r2Key": "media/1791223576181_2wnj75.mp4", "thumbKey": "media/1791223574380_7wcl9c.jpg"}, {"type": "video", "r2Key": "media/1791223576138_k36dx0.mp4", "thumbKey": "media/1791223574380_j09cw3.jpg"}], "likes": ["unknown"], "comments": [{"user": "unknown", "text": "👍", "time": "2026-10-05T18:18:18.334Z"}]}, {"id": "f_muuyt68g_27y9", "note": "这个点是在我们矿区正南部7-8公里，也是具有潜力的范围！露头发现钽铁矿颗粒，0.08%钽含量，以及风化的水晶，地质构造和我们矿区一样！\n之所以取这个点也是因为验证地质报告，整个钽铌矿范围！\n这个矿证是下一步明年准备去拿！", "uploader": "Frank", "createdAt": "2026-10-05T08:05:33.520Z", "media": [{"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791187532435_th9mfs.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791187532435_f29xus.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791187532434_8s6wu5.jpg"}], "likes": [], "comments": []}, {"id": "f_muub6ijz_cvw1", "note": "三盘磁选机\n专门处理分选钽铌矿中的钛铁等杂质，对提纯有很大帮助！", "uploader": "管理员", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T21:04:05.231Z", "media": [{"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791147844261_vzooaa.jpg"}], "likes": [], "comments": [], "updatedAt": "2026-10-05T01:17:38.802Z"}, {"id": "f_muu8jmdn_h15k", "note": "这是摇床洗出来的钽铌精粉，钽含量9-10%；铌8-9%；但铁和钛有55%！目前重选已经无法分离他们，因为铁钛的重量和钽铌矿相近，需要用三盘磁选机来分离！\n按目前的产能测算，一台摇床大概能产5公斤左右10%钽铌矿！", "uploader": "管理员", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T19:50:17.867Z", "media": [{"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143416310_psaadq.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143416308_00sqi0.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143416310_3rwmc2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143416310_7r95sl.jpg"}], "likes": [], "comments": [], "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T21:08:19.800Z"}, {"id": "f_muu8clp6_o07c", "note": "今日刚到矿区\n这个黑疙瘩，钽含量70%\n在水池的地方挖到", "uploader": "管理员", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T19:44:50.394Z", "media": [{"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143088064_1n0sxp.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143088065_czzirx.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143088064_7d3ymd.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "r2Key": "media/1791143088062_wczi1t.jpg"}], "likes": ["unknown"], "comments": []}, {"id": "f_muu8anpa_1hl2", "note": "塞伦杰印度佬合资矿区生产现场", "uploader": "管理员", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T19:43:19.678Z", "media": [{"type": "video", "r2Key": "media/1791142766465_s5cpys.mp4", "thumbKey": "media/1791142765464_3nhc6e.jpg"}, {"type": "video", "r2Key": "media/1791142766732_m62mzf.mp4", "thumbKey": "media/1791142765464_obqtvx.jpg"}, {"type": "video", "r2Key": "media/1791142766846_fdgy6l.mp4", "thumbKey": "media/1791142765462_z6vab9.jpg"}], "likes": [], "comments": [], "updatedAt": "2026-10-05T06:07:51.823Z"}], "updatedAt": "2026-10-05T18:36:00.194Z", "users": [{"name": "Natalie"}], "todos": []}